<title>AUSTRIA: INDONESIA'S SUDJANA ARRIVES FOR OPEC MEETING.</title>
<headline>INDONESIA'S SUDJANA ARRIVES FOR OPEC MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian oil minister Ida Bagus Sudjana arrived in Vienna on Tuesday for this week's OPEC conference but made no comment to reporters.</p>
<p>Sudjana is a member of the three-man quota compliance committee scheduled to meet at 1300 GMT today. The other members are Iran's Gholamreza Aghazadeh and Nigeria's Dan Etete, who are already in Vienna.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 713 2002</p>
</text>
